  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Template selection",
      "items": [
        "D denotes one descriptor, commonly D2Q9Descriptor or D3Q27Descriptor; d / q / c / w encode its lattice.",
        "BGKDynamicsSelection::prepare<D>(resolvedConfig) constructs BGKDynamics<D> from omega.",
        "The composition edge to BGKDynamics describes the illustrated Dyn specialization, not a fixed restriction on generic CollisionOperator.",
        "BGKDynamics inherits IsoThermalDynamicsModelBase<D>, which inherits LocalDynamicsModel<D>; these marker bases are omitted from the drawing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Dispatch and fields",
      "items": [
        "Operator defines virtual name() and scope(). apply() is not a virtual method on that base.",
        "The level operator traverses AMReX tiles and invokes device-safe kernels. collide(Cell&&) uses compile-time dispatch.",
        "LatticeField wraps population MultiFab storage directly; it does not inherit RealField. MacroField does inherit RealField.",
        "Field arguments are borrowed. Operators do not retain ownership of the source or destination fields."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Scope",
      "items": [
        "AI-generated with Archify; only selected fields, methods and type relations are shown.",
        "Field = LatticeField<D>; Real = amrex::Real. Exact overloads and const/noexcept qualifiers are in sources.md.",
        "This structural map is not evidence of numerical correctness or validated full-GPU parallel execution."
      ]
    }
  ]
